OL,3,GNEWSABaby Tommy's our 'light', says
OL,4,Agrieving family of newborn whose mum
OL,5,Adied in childbirth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a first-time mum who died
OL,8,Fin childbirth say her newborn son is
OL,9,Fthe "light" that's keeping them going
OL,10,Fthrough their grief.
OL,12,FChelsea McGillivray suffered an unknown
OL,13,Fcardiac event during labour last Monday
OL,14,Fafter what was believed to be a
OL,15,Ftextbook pregnancy.
OL,17,FThe 31-year-old, from Rutherglen in
OL,18,FSouth Lanarkshire, received CPR but
OL,19,Fdoctors were unable to resuscitate her.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
